Fallout 4 is another good game from the Fallout franchise, but a lot weaker than the previous ones:
PROS:
- Huge world to explore;
- A lot of contents to waste some hours;
CONS
- The lore is weak and unilateral;
- Limited modifications and armor/weapons types;
- Content is based in a lot of Radiant quests that are meaningless;
- Lots of bugs that break the fluidity of the gameplay (modders helped you here).

